# This adds italic capabilities to Tmux.
#
# Enable it with `tic tmux.terminfo`.
#
# Ncurses seems to have tmux-256color terminfo files built-in, just some distros
# seem to package them into a separate package, so this file shouldn't be
# neceseery.

tmux-256color|Tmux with 256 colors,
    smso=\E[7m, rmso=\E[27m,
    sitm=\E[3m, ritm=\E[23m,
    use=screen-256color,
